{"embedding_dim": 768, "data": [{"__id__": "chunk-dcbfd002e14a61aaffb86d7ffeddef18", "__created_at__": 1768901904, "content": "Viêm gan B là một bệnh nhiễm trùng gan do virus viêm gan B (HBV) gây ra.\nTriệu chứng bao gồm vàng da, mệt mỏi, buồn nôn và đau bụng.\nTenofovir là thuốc kháng virus dùng để điều trị viêm gan B mãn tính.\nTuy nhiên, Tenofovir có thể gây tác dụng phụ như suy thận và loãng xương.", "full_doc_id": "doc-dcbfd002e14a61aaffb86d7ffeddef18", "file_path": "unknown_source", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "chunk-1da80ab7d5e9dc4c2df78295fb5e2d98", "__created_at__": 1768905336, "content": "CASE STUDY: DIABETIC KETOACIDOSIS (DKA)\nA 25-year-old patient with Type 1 Diabetes presents with severe nausea, vomiting, and abdominal pain.\nPhysical exam reveals Kussmaul respirations and a fruity breath odor (acetone).\nLab results show high blood glucose (Hyperglycemia) and metabolic acidosis.\nTreatment involves aggressive IV fluids (Normal Saline) and Insulin infusion to lower blood sugar.\nPotassium levels must be monitored carefully as Insulin causes hypokalemia (low potassium).", "full_doc_id": "doc-1da80ab7d5e9dc4c2df78295fb5e2d98", "file_path": "unknown_source", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "chunk-88c1397985267e906468ad9f26a69621", "__created_at__": 1768905645, "content": "CASE STUDY: DIABETIC KETOACIDOSIS (DKA)\nA 25-year-old patient with Type 1 Diabetes presents with severe nausea, vomiting, and abdominal pain.\nPhysical exam reveals Kussmaul respirations and a fruity breath odor.\nLab results show Hyperglycemia and metabolic acidosis.\nTreatment involves aggressive IV fluids (Normal Saline) and Insulin infusion.\nPotassium levels must be monitored as Insulin causes hypokalemia.", "full_doc_id": "doc-88c1397985267e906468ad9f26a69621", "file_path": "unknown_source", "vector": ""}], "matrix": ""}